{"step_index":114,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T17:15:53Z","thinking":"**Designing Project Scripts**\n\nI'm currently focused on structuring the project's scripts, specifically how to execute the Node/Vite frontend and Python backend components within the project. I'm planning to create a `package.json` file in `C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch` to coordinate these scripts, allowing developers to choose between npm and python execution. I'm also planning a pure JavaScript frontend version.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nWORKSPACE = Path(r'C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch')\nSRC = WORKSPACE / 'frontend' / 'src'\n\n# Transpile / clean main.ts into pure ES6 main.js by stripping type annotations\nmain_ts = (SRC / 'main.ts').read_text(encoding='utf-8')\nmain_js = main_ts\nfor t in [' as HTMLInputElement', ' as HTMLSelectElement', ' as HTMLTextAreaElement', ' as HTMLElement', ' as HTMLAnchorElement', ' as HTMLFormElement', ' as NodeListOf<HTMLInputElement>', ' as any', ': Trip[]', ': Trip', ': Destination[]', ': Destination', ': any[]', ': any', ': string[]', ': string', ': number', ': boolean', 'interface Trip {', 'interface Destination {']:\n    if 'interface ' in t:\n        pass\n    else:\n        main_js = main_js.replace(t, '')\n\n# Clean interfaces from main_js\nlines = []\nin_interface = False\nfor line in main_js.split('\\n'):\n    if line.strip().startswith('interface '):\n        in_interface = True\n        continue\n    if in_interface:\n        if line.strip() == '}':\n            in_interface = False\n        continue\n    lines.append(line)\n\nmain_js_clean = '\\n'.join(lines)\n(SRC / 'main.js').write_text(main_js_clean, encoding='utf-8')\n\n# Update index.html to load /src/main.js\nidx = (WORKSPACE / 'frontend' / 'index.html').read_text(encoding='utf-8')\nidx = idx.replace('/src/main.ts', '/src/main.js')\n(WORKSPACE / 'frontend' / 'index.html').write_text(idx, encoding='utf-8')\n\n# Create package.json\npkg = {\n    'name': 'triptrail-natpac-survey',\n    'version': '2.0.0',\n    'description': 'TripTrail & NATPAC Mobile Travel Survey Platform (SIH 2025)',\n    'type': 'module',\n    'scripts': {\n        'start': 'python run.py',\n        'server': 'python run.py',\n        'dev': 'python run.py',\n        'backend': 'python run.py',\n        'test': 'python -m unittest discover tests'\n    },\n    'dependencies': {}\n}\n(WORKSPACE / 'package.json').write_text(json.dumps(pkg, indent=2), encoding='utf-8')\n\nprint('main.js, index.html, and package.json updated successfully!')\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\akhil\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Generating standalone main.js and package.json","toolSummary":"Generate main.js and package.json"}}]}
